<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - UBS picks UK mid-cap stocks for 97.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - UBS picks UK mid-cap stocks for 97.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strategists at UBS on Tuesday confirmed a list of nine UK mid-cap stocks they expect to outperform through 1997.</p>
<p>The nine were South West Water Plc, paper and packaging group Arjo Wiggins Appleton Plc, computer services group CMG Plc, specialist materials group Cookson Plc, caterer Compass Group Plc, soccer club Manchester United Plc, electronics distributor Premier Farnell Plc, Pizza Express Plc and oil exploration group British-Borneo Petroleum Syndicate Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
